  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むだな　にくを　すてさると　こころがとぎすまされ　サイコパワーが　あがる。ぜいにくは　たんぱくだが　おいしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "불필요한 살을 분리하면 정신이 예민해져 사이코 파워가 상승한다. 떨어진 살은 담백하고 맛있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "捨棄不必要的肉，能使其心靈受到磨練，精神力量得以提升。贅肉滋味清淡，但卻相當可口。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pour aiguiser son esprit et renforcer ses pouvoirs psychiques, il se défait de sa chair en trop. Celle-ci a un goût léger, mais exquis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wirft es überflüssige Teile seines Körpers ab, steigen seine Psycho-Kräfte. Der Geschmack des abgeworfenen Fleisches ist simpel, aber lecker.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al desechar la carne que no necesita, agudiza la mente y sus poderes psíquicos se incrementan. Dicha carne tiene un sabor suave pero exquisito.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si libera della carne in eccesso per affinare i sensi e aumentare i suoi poteri psichici. Le parti superflue sono leggere ma saporite.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When Veluza discards unnecessary flesh, its mind becomes honed and its psychic power increases. The spare flesh has a mild but delicious flavor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無駄な　肉を　捨て去ると　心が研ぎ澄まされ　サイコパワーが　上がる。贅肉は　淡白だが　美味しい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "舍弃不必要的肉，能让心灵得以磨砺，精神力量得以提升。赘肉口味清淡，却十分美味。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al desechar la carne que no necesita, agudiza la mente y sus poderes psíquicos se incrementan. Dicha carne tiene un sabor suave pero exquisito.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たかい　！\u0004\t再生能力さいせいのうりょく再生能力を　もつ。からだの　ぜいにくを　すててみがるになり　えものに　とつげき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "높은 재생 능력을 자랑한다. 군살을 버려서 몸을 가볍게 하고 먹잇감을 향해 돌격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有強大的再生能力。會丟棄身上的贅肉讓自己變得輕盈後突擊獵物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Passé maître dans l’art de la régénération, ce Pokémon se débarrasse de sa chair en trop pour gagner en agilité, puis il fond sur ses proies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann sich sehr schnell regenerieren. Wirft es Teile seines Körpers ab, wird es leichter und ist somit imstande, seine Beute flink zu attackieren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee una magnífica capacidad regenerativa. Se desprende de carne que no necesita para ganar agilidad y arremeter contra sus presas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha eccellenti capacità rigenerative. Si libera della carne in eccesso per scagliarsi più agilmente sulla preda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Veluza has excellent regenerative capabilities. It sheds spare flesh from its body to boost its agility, then charges at its prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "高い　！\u0004\t再生能力さいせいのうりょく再生能力を　持つ。体の　贅肉を　捨てて身軽になり　獲物に　突撃。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有强大的再生能力。会丢弃身上的赘肉来让自己变得轻盈后再去突击猎物。",
